{{Description|A two-tiered holy edifice in Ragunna City, devoted to the worship of the Sentinel's statue. It also serves as the seat of the Order of the Deep. The upper water chapel connects to the sea that flows through Ragunna City, with its waters rising and falling with the tides as if breathing in time with the Sentinel. Thus, it is known as the Tidal Sanctuary.}} 
{{Intro/Location|Cathedral of Mercury}}

It is the seat of the [[Order of the Deep]].

